# Fire and Brimstone (windurst 73, RNG AF2): Perih Vashai (Windurst Woods; default 338; containers: Sin Hunting
# (Progress 523 while available to a RNG 40+; completed here), The Fanged One (Progress 351 while available at 30+;
# completed here), From Saplings Grow (archery 250: not at level 50), Trust: Shikaree Z and CoP 5-3 (#cop)). The steps
# between stay in Lua (they set only the var): the flow sets it by GM. His default 338 is a DefaultActions event the
# interaction framework alternates with his script (the fallback turn), so each quest talk follows a default's turn.
# RNG 50 (AF2_QUEST_LEVEL 50), Sin Hunting completed: 531, option 0: begun, var 1. Var 1 / 3: 532; var 4: 535: var 5;
# 536. Var 6 (accepted): no reply from either quest: 338. The earring at var 4 / 6: nothing; at var 5: a glue alone:
# nothing; the earring and a glue (npcUtil.tradeHas is not exact): 537: completed (Hunter's Beret, fame 20, var 0), the
# earring taken, the glue kept. Completed, var 0: this quest answers nothing: Unbridled Passion's 541, option 1: begun.
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=116.0,-3.7,90.45 job=RNG lvl=50
quest Windurst.SinHunting completed
quest Windurst.TheFangedOne completed
item OldEarring
item BlockOfAnimalGlue
login
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # the default's turn: 338
finish
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # Sin Hunting completed, RNG 50 (the AF2 level), available: 531
finish option=0                         # begun; var 1
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # the default's turn: 338
finish
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # var 1: 532
finish
charvar fireAndBrimstone 3
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # the default's turn: 338
finish
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # var 3: 532
finish
charvar fireAndBrimstone 4
trade Perih_Vashai OldEarring x1        # var 4: nothing
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # the default's turn: 338
finish
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # var 4: 535 (0, 13360, 1113)
finish                                  # var 5
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # the default's turn: 338
finish
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # var 5: 536 (0, 13360, 1113)
finish
charvar fireAndBrimstone 6
trade Perih_Vashai OldEarring x1        # var 6: nothing
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # the default's turn: 338
finish
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # var 6, accepted: no reply from either quest: 338
finish
charvar fireAndBrimstone 5
trade Perih_Vashai BlockOfAnimalGlue x1 # var 5, no earring: nothing
trade Perih_Vashai OldEarring x1 BlockOfAnimalGlue x1  # var 5, the earring (and a glue): 537 (0, 13360)
finish                                  # completed: Hunter's Beret, fame 20, var 0; the earring taken, the glue kept
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # the default's turn: 338
finish
trigger Perih_Vashai                    # completed, var 0: Unbridled Passion's 541 (0, 13360)
finish option=1                         # Unbridled Passion begun; its var 1
